# Festival of Embers is a permission, not an alternative cost (CR 118.9a, 601.2b, 601.2f): Bot2's Duress puts Bot1's Fireblast in its graveyard, and on turn 3,
# with the Festival out, Bot1 casts the Fireblast from there for its own alternative cost - sacrificing its two Mountains rather than paying {4}{R}{R} - with the
# Festival's 1 life owed on top, paid once (Bot1 19). Bot2 takes 4 and the Fireblast is exiled as it resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Festival of Embers
Fireblast
Mountain
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Duress
Swamp x18

